# Declining Land Tax does not search; accepting and finding nothing still shuffles, and equal land counts prevent the upkeep trigger (CR 603.4, 701.24a).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Land Tax
Plains x25

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Land Tax.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Decline
? Bot1.Shuffles = 0
[T5 Bot1.Upkeep]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Search()
? Bot1.Shuffles = 1
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T7 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 0
[Expect]
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Tapped = false
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = false
